      "id": "freeText_1777596470970",
      "text": "## Welcome!\n\n#### *If the topology canvas is locked (indicated by the red padlock at the top of the palette) -- Simply click the lock to unlock the topology to begin editing.*\n\nGet started by selecting an `Arista cEOS` or `Linux Host` node from the palette and dragging it into the topology canvas.\n\nAdd links by right-clicking nodes and selecting `Create Link.`\n\nLinux hosts can be configured by right-clicking and selecting `Edit Node` and then `Configuration.`\n\nThe following can be configured on a Linux Host:\n- IPv4 Address\n- IPv6 Address (*optional*)\n- MAC Address (*optional*)\n- Default Gateway\n- Connect Mode (*optional*): `lacp` or `none.`\n\nAny *optional* value can be deleted or left blank in the `Configuration` section.\n\n### *Delete this text block at any time by right-clicking it and selecting `Delete Text`*",
